                <head>No. 595.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cushing to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 17,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Payments anticipated. Forty-five thousand dollars to be delivered to-day.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <closer><signed>CUSHING.</signed></closer>
